Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To our new relationship,\Nand our new friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And, to prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The view from here makes me\Nsad that I must leave so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an amazing sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, we should have dinner together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cantonese cuisine that\Nour head chef makes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.15,0:02:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,is just about as superb as this scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful invitation, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that the day that I'd dine with\Nan executive from the Red Dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured,\Nthe food will not be poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally take a breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing things like this won't do you any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Times have changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The syndicate cannot survive\Njust by fighting alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Only if Spike returned...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,someone like you would...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, I don't feel like doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't burden you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who that is, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Superficial stuff, yeah. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good money. Easy to get info on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, you're deliberately\Navoiding the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So... what happened to that arm of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that have to do\Nwith anything? {4 frames extra lead-in. Original: "What does that have to do with anything?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you have no intention of telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this door so damn narrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Am I interrupting something? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be comrades!\NThat's awfully cold of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, comrades? Troublemakers\Nshould keep themselves outta this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who is this? What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look without asking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?\NHe's just there on the screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike! Shit, I won't be responsible for you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! He's such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Yenrai. A bounty of 28 million\Nfor the alleged murder
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of an executive from an opposing syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing! And you guys are after him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you have a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up. You're being obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, you're such a kid. {added the "Heh," so this can be reasonably timed}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, you're being obnoxious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He can do whatever\Nthe hell he pleases.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God... He's throwing such a huge fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You there, Jet? I got something big for ya!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something big?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but I need to see your ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, I am afraid that\Nyou cannot enter the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But, they told me I didn't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know. The guy in the box seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Him.{\i0} {1 frame extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Yenra— {end on the finger or snap to end keyframe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you park my vehicle for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not one, it's the other...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they all do\Neverything as they please?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a protective\Nencryption on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch. These are decrypted like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,See? And then, I input "Mao Yenrai"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounty part sure seems to be true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Mao-taijin's seat? (Sir Mao)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked all over for it. Actually, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We were waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They are performing, so please stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there! {letting bleed to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. Give it back, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, kids these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hand you over to the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You! {remove the hesitation?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't it bad for you to\Ndrink it in one shot, Annie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You coming back to life\Nis worse on me than this glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What terrible treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The words of the dead are meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you died three years ago!\NThat's how things work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you came here... means you\Nhave something you want to know, right? {13 frame link}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not much, I can be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! There are only two people\Nthat can call me by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Yenrai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao-taijin? There's a reason for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to talk, Miss Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have done a background check already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, it will be\Nheld in a safe location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, to your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trembling...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who... are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't say anything bad to ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get yourself involved\Nwith Vicious anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know saying that is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never listened to what others say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of it, you're a stubborn showoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't hurt you to listen to\Nyour elders once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,About Mao...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a lot of people looking\Nfor you after you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that you still had to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally back, but Mao is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.27,0:12:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that one for Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to now...\Nto need something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the broad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She lost sanity looking at\Nthe bounty figure and took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now she's probably\Nsomewhere, screwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you something.\NYou won't get the bounty for Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already dead. He was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Internal discord. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a trap! I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I know all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what, you're Mao's?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him one from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you something, Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the price I paid for being over-spirited\Nand running ahead of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say, duties of the life I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tee hee. I've been caught.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to the place we specify.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Otherwise, my life is over. So they say.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.87,0:13:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lessee... the time to meet is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you did as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're being cold.{\i0}\N{\i1}We're comrades, remember?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You reap what you sow.\NTake care of it all yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, wait!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're really gonna come?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm not going there to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Angels that are forced from heaven\Nhave to become demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Spike?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only watching a dream\Nthat I never awakened from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wake you up right now. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so anxious, Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our first meeting in a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A plea for your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that doesn't\Nwork on you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you even kill\Nthose who've saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a beast who lost his fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The same goes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we want you to drop your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? If you don't hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are ya tryin' to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, what the hell've I done...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.31,0:17:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank God! Jet? Spike is—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,God dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what your face\Nlooks like right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The same blood runs in you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood of a beast who wanders,\Ndesiring the blood of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've bled all of that blood away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you still alive?! {let bleed?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,sing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've slept too much.\NIt's been 3 days. {original: "three"}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I was worried about you.\NYou have to be thankful to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tone-deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
