Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:15.73,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.99,0:23:15.73,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what? What a tough\Nworld we live in nowadays...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.35,0:23:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy, that guy... They're all trying\Nto put a lid on something that stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Can we let things go on like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.69,0:23:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you,\Nwhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,World affairs, man! World affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,With all these lids about,\Nthe world'll be buried in lids!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,With stuff like that, you can't see the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So lids like that... I'll crush them all away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.81,0:23:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Episode: Sympathy for the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.29,0:23:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds... smelly.
